    "App 内计时仍会继续，请稍后在通知设置中重试。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The in-app timer will keep running. Try again later in notification settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 在前台时显示页内提醒；锁屏或退出 App 后由系统本地通知提醒。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In-app alerts appear while RepDay is open. Local notifications take over when the app is locked or closed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 语言" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Because we do not collect your data, we do not retain it on our systems. Deleting RepDay removes data stored by the app. Calendar events created at your request remain under your control in the Calendar app." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于我们不收集你的数据，因此也不会在我们的系统中保留数据。删除 RepDay 会移除 App 在本机保存的数据；应你要求创建的日历事件仍由你在“日历”App 中管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar access (optional)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
